{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob19woLo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob8goAab.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までずーっと、いつものキラさんでした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single BACKS LIVE!!\n増本綺良卒業セレモニー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、キラさんの卒業を知った後に、仲良くさせていただいて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キラさんと話したり、遊び回ったり、ふざけ合うたびにこんな時間ももうあと少しなのかな、って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう卒業されるのに、と思ってしまう時もありました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと、別れが辛くなるんだろうなって。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもずっとキラさんはキラさんで！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業を感じさせずにこの期間を過ごすって多分ほぼ不可能なことじゃないですか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業の日が近づくに連れ寂しさが増したり、現実味を帯びてきたり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しかしその不可能を可能にしたんです、キラさんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはあくまでも私から見たキラさんですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にいい意味でずっと通常運転で不思議な方でツンデレさんで不器用で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも、2日目の当日のリハーサルでドレス姿を見た時に、初めて卒業を実感しちゃいました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、もうこの先一緒に活動できないんだなって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも寂しさはちょっぴり感じても、辛いなとは思わなかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いーっぱい、愛を受け取ったので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと、この期間で中途半端ではなく、たくさん愛を頂いたからこそこう思えるのかな~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobOx1ICQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobMOa1CU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しお見せできないお顔でしたのでましゅにしました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「その日まで」でお迎えに行かせていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わしが選んだわけじゃないで！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とリハーサルの時に言われ、面白かったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも照れくさそうな顔をされていて\n私も照れちゃいました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このエスコート役をできて嬉しかったな~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一生の思い出です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobHdD4ch.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "絶対、キラさん泣かないだろうから、私も泣かない！って決めていたのですが、やっぱりダメでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今までの全てが脳内で再生されて、頭の中は大変でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobGH9tLc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobpdDItN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/moby4GSRK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちらはちょこさくの時の"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "急遽リアルミート＆グリートが開かれ、私も参加させていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルすぎました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3枚目の、最後の見送ってる笑顔が好きです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キラさんはきっと、他の人が何十年、何百年追い続けても誰も捉えることのできない方だと思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても唯一無二が似合う、というかこの言葉がイコールというか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はキラさんを隅々まで知ることはできなかったです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんもそうだったりしますか、、？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっとずっと、楽しかったです\nママンになって下さりありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業セレモニーの際、ママンから巣立つ宣言をしましたが、前言撤回します！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1人になるから巣立とうかな、と考えていたのですが\nずっとママンの存在は心の中にいるし、私にとって大切な過去で存在で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱりずっとママンと娘の関係でいたいなって改めて思ったので、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ママンから受け取った全てを活かしながら、\n娘、これからも精進して参ります🫡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日は15th Single BACKS LIVE!!、2日目の配信があります！\nキラさんの卒業セレモニーも🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://sakurazaka46.com/s/s46/page/backslive_15th?ima=0000&link=ROBO004"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "観ましょー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までブログを読んで下さりありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また来てね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "山田桃実"}], "source": "official"}